.
.  Create a GIF file for a run sequence plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
set ipl1na runseq.ps
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ MAVRO.DAT Y
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 4
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Index
Y1LABEL Transmittance
LABEL SIZE 4
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 12
YTIC MARK LABEL DECIMALS 4
MAJOR YTIC MARK NUMBER 6
XTIC OFFSET 2 2
TIC OFFSET UNITS DATA
THICKNESS 0.2
CHARACTER X
LINE BLANK
.
PLOT Y
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
system mv RUNSEQ.PS runseq.ps
QUIT
